    "title": "Yuma Kite Festival returns March 14",
    "text": "The City of Yuma’s Parks and Recreation Department is inviting the community to enjoy a free afternoon of kite flying and spectating at the annual Yuma Kite Festival.\nThe event is scheduled for Saturday, March 14, from 1 to 4 p.m. at the Pacific Avenue Athletic Complex, 1700 E. 8th St.",
